WEBVTT

00:24:58.728 --> 00:25:02.006
What you're enabling in China
is pretty incredible.

00:25:02.030 --> 00:25:04.196
Switching gears
in this conversation slightly,

00:25:04.220 --> 00:25:08.230
as a child, I was told that God watched
every move I made,

00:25:08.254 --> 00:25:11.149
when I die, that there would be
this final judgment

00:25:11.173 --> 00:25:13.602
where the good and bad we'd done
would be weighed up

00:25:13.626 --> 00:25:15.745
and we'd go with the sheep
or with the goats.

00:25:15.769 --> 00:25:17.286
And in different ways,

00:25:17.310 --> 00:25:19.484
parents all over the world
tell their children

00:25:19.508 --> 00:25:21.064
that Santa Claus is watching,

00:25:21.088 --> 00:25:23.720
knows whether you've been naughty or nice.

00:25:23.744 --> 00:25:29.341
It's possible that humans need
a little bit of fear in their lives

00:25:29.365 --> 00:25:30.515
to behave.